  /* ---------- payment options (Build 045) ----------
     One UPI card on top: the shopper's UPI apps as big tiles (tap = pay straight away in that app), "All UPI apps"
     (the phone's own app picker) and "Pay via UPI ID" (PayU's page, where the UPI ID is typed). Under it one row
